"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
3027,"###
 Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna and Al-Hasan bin Muhammad Az-Za'farani narrated to us, saying: Husayn narrated to us. Az-Za'farani specified: Ibn Al-Hasan. He said: Ibn 'Awn narrated to us from Ibrahim and Al-Qasim from the Mother of the Believers (Aisha).

And in another narration: Ad-Dawraqi narrated to us, Ibn 'Ulayyah narrated to us, from Ibn 'Awn, from Ibrahim, from Al"
